    {
      "id": "un4hagi",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "13. Importance of Classification"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ixrtc39",
      "content": "• Helps in identification."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ewocpt3",
      "content": "• Shows evolutionary relationships."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2flsuqp",
      "content": "• Provides universal naming system."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "g1llaug",
      "content": "• Avoids confusion of local names."
    },
    {
      "id": "l2u7eqh",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "14. Modern Three Domain System"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zny1stp",
      "content": "Carl Woese proposed three domain system: Bacteria, Archaea and Eukarya based on rRNA studies."
    },
    {
