    {
      "id": "xfy9hvk",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "20. Quick Exam Facts (RRB Focus)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dwz6m06",
      "content": "1. Five kingdom system proposed by R.H. Whittaker (1969)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2890lsa",
      "content": "2. Monera are prokaryotic."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7p93jfu",
      "content": "3. Fungi have chitin cell wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pl5fkyy",
      "content": "4. Plantae are autotrophic."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "b44amie",
      "content": "5. Animalia lack cell wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bctfww2",
      "content": "6. Binomial nomenclature given by Linnaeus."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fbvddj2",
      "content": "7. Species is basic unit of classification."
    }
  ],
